Changes V1 -> V2:

- Rebase on current net-next.

- Introduce new tcf_classify_ingress() function that is only called from
  ingress data path. Put all skb_ext-handling code into the new function
  and call regular tcf_classify() with tcf_proto instance obtained as a
  result of skb chain extension lookup.

- Extend tcf_classify() with 'orig_tp' argument. It is necessary to
  distinguish tp obtained from skb chain extension from original tp that
  is needed by reclassify functionality.

- Embed pointer to block into mini_Qdisc. Use it to directly obtain pointer
  to block from atomic data path context instead of extending Qdisc ops API
  with ingress_block_get_rcu() callback.
